### Student create
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user_name": "thisUserIsStudent",
    "user_email": "thisUserIsStudent@gmail.com",
    "user_pass": "12345678",
    "role": "read"
}

