### Getting posts
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/posts?page=1&amountOfPosts=1
Content-Type: application/json


### Search for posts
GET  http://127.0.0.1:3000/posts/search?q=requis
Content-Type: application/json


### Get one post
GET  http://127.0.0.1:3000/posts/696826a294a54440b36627bb
Content-Type: application/json


### Creating Post 
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/posts
Content-Type: application/json


{
    "user_name": "1",
    "post_title": "Implementando arquivo de requisições http",
    "post_description": "Esse post é um teste para implementação de requisições http.",
    "post_videp_url": "https://teacherVideo.com.br"
}

### Modifying Post 
PUT http://127.0.0.1:3000/posts/696826a294a54440b36627bb
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user_name": "NewName"
}

### Delete Post
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:3000/posts/696826a294a54440b36627bb
Content-Type: application/json

### Logout User
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/users/logout
Content-Type: application/json
